    <briefdescription>
<para>RPC Client for shard-to-shard communication. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>v1.3.0: Basic RPC implementation for distributed transactions Supports 2PC (Two-Phase Commit) protocol messages</para>
<para>v1.3.4: Added gRPC support for multi-node cluster deployments<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Real gRPC connections for horizontal scaling</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic retry with exponential backoff</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Connection keepalive and pooling</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Healthcheck endpoint</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Error categorization (retryable vs non-retryable) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
